The EEG data in this directory are derived from the ERP CORE Flanker dataset:

Kappenman, E. S., Farrens, J. L., Zhang, W., Stewart, A. X., & Luck, S. J.
(2021). ERP CORE: An open resource for human event-related potential
research. NeuroImage, 225, 117465.
https://doi.org/10.1016/j.neuroimage.2020.117465

Changes made: data were downsampled to 256 Hz, annotations were converted for ease of further processing, and the data were saved in MNE fif format. No other content was altered.

